WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.152
Freshness is one of the clearest differences among these tools.

00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:09.392
A common table expression reads the source data available to its statement.

00:00:09.392 --> 00:00:14.672
A standard view reads through to the current underlying data when it is queried.

00:00:14.672 --> 00:00:17.472
A materialized view is different.

00:00:17.472 --> 00:00:21.602
It keeps the stored result from its most recent refresh.

00:00:21.602 --> 00:00:26.043
Users should never have to guess which freshness model they are working with.
